world  catapult

floor

catapult
  pivot    40 cm up
  arm      1 m, 300 g
  swings   about y, from 0° to 55°
  spring   3 N·m/rad toward 150°
  damping  0.05 N·m·s/rad

ball
  is a      sphere 6 cm, 150 g
  is        rolls, dead
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.004
  sits      in catapult

bucket
  is an   open box 80 by 80 cm, walls 40 cm
  stands  on floor, 2.92 m beyond ball

expect
  ball comes to rest in bucket
